	(text "OPad carrier V3: Waveshare headers, USB cable from the USB board, module FFC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 330.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f084142c-4e8b-428f-9726-34376e7c2654"))
	(text "Module FFC: 1 GND | 2 5V | 3 3V3 | 4 ID=GPIO8 | 5 MISO=GPIO6 | 6 GND | 7 SCLK=GPIO2 | 8 MOSI=GPIO4 | 9 GND | 10 CS=GPIO10 | 11 SPARE=GPIO7 | 12 3V3 | 13 5V | 14 GND; a reversed cable maps k to 15-k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 333.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "74429d35-21df-4dee-8c88-aa9678ec5047"))
	(text "USB FFC: 1 GND | 2 5V | 3 D- | 4 D+ | 5 D+ | 6 D- | 7 5V | 8 GND (the same read from either end); 5V -> P1-14, D+ -> P1-11 (GPIO20), D- -> P1-12 (GPIO19). The USB board filters and protects it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 337.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f1356370-3174-4f41-8757-cd2f1d18d9f9"))
